      "1-year arc is shorter than the 18.6-year lunar nodal period; the residual between the corrected secular and the 1-year numerical is dominated by short-period terms not included in the secular formula. Multi-year byte-pinned DE441 acquisition would be needed to fully resolve the long-period terms.",
